{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ki-expresses-strong-intention","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The combination of the conjunctionalizer kusu with the auxiliary verb ki expresses a stronger intention than rusuy.","ja":"接続詞化辞 kusu と動詞 ki の結合は、rusuy よりも強い話者の意図を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu ki","kusu","ki"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0200-02","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0201-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"contrasts","claim":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kus-ne-expresses-intention","differs_in":"dialect","note":"Shizunai uses kusu ki for the intentional mood where other Hokkaido dialects use kus(u) ne."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ki-second-person-subject","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"Expressions with kusu ki may take a second-person subject in interrogative and conditional sentences.","ja":"kusu ki を伴う表現は、疑問文および条件文において二人称主語をとることができる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"some","modality":"assertive","conditions":["in interrogative and conditional sentences"]},"forms":["kusu ki"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0200-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0201-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ki-inanimate-subject-prohibited","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"Expressions with kusu ki cannot take an inanimate subject because a conscious agent is presupposed.","ja":"有意識の動作主が前提とされるため、kusu ki を伴う表現は無情物の主語をとることができない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"none","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu ki"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0200-05","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0201-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kus-ne-expresses-intention","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary kus(u) ne expresses the speaker's intention or volition ('intend to, will').","ja":"助動詞 kus(u) ne は話者の意志・意図（「〜するつもりだ」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["kus ne","kusu ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0208-02","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0210-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--nankor-expresses-epistemic-conjecture","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--nankor"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary nankor expresses epistemic conjecture or probability ('probably, will likely').","ja":"助動詞 nankor は推量や蓋然性（「〜だろう」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["nankor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0307-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0101-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--auxiliary-anan-expresses-confirmation","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary anan expresses confirmation of a past state or event ('was indeed / had been').","ja":"助動詞 anan は過去の事態の確認（「〜だったのだ」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["anan"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0347-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0383-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-light-noun-pe-p-expresses-assertive-modality","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality"],"statement":{"en":"The light noun pe/p expresses assertive modality or pragmatic imperative.","ja":"形式名詞pe/pは断定のモダリティまたは語用論的命令を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["pe","p"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2016@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-10","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-light-noun-kat-u-expresses-assertive-modality","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality"],"statement":{"en":"The light noun kat-u expresses assertive modality.","ja":"形式名詞kat-uは断定のモダリティを表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kat-u"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2016@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-11","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-light-noun-hi-expresses-assertive-modality","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality"],"statement":{"en":"The light noun hi expresses assertive modality.","ja":"形式名詞hiは断定のモダリティを表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hi"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2016@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-12","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--a-predicate-may-be-especially-asserted-or-emphasized","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality"],"statement":{"en":"A predicate may be especially asserted or emphasized by employing the verb ki 'do' as an auxiliary.","ja":"述語は、動詞 ki（する）を助動詞として用いることで特に断定または強調されうる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["ki"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0203-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-restrictive-postposition-ka-is-often-interpolated-between","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality"],"statement":{"en":"The restrictive postposition ka is often interpolated between the main verb and the assertive auxiliary ki to strengthen the emphasis.","ja":"強調を強めるために、本動詞と断定の助動詞 ki の間に限定の後置詞 ka がしばしば挿入される。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ka","ki"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0203-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--when-parallel-verb-expressions-are-asserted-with-ka","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality"],"statement":{"en":"When parallel verb expressions are asserted with ka ki, the inclusive meaning of ka is clearly demonstrated.","ja":"並列する動詞表現が ka ki によって断定される場合、ka の包含的意味が明確に現れる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["two parallel verb expressions are both asserted with ka ki"]},"forms":["ka","ki"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0203-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-assertive-auxiliary-ki-primarily-affects-the-verb","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality"],"statement":{"en":"The assertive auxiliary ki primarily affects the verb expression of which it forms a part, whereas an assertive sentence-final form evaluates the sentence as a totality.","ja":"断定の助動詞 ki はそれが一部を成す動詞表現を主に作用対象とするのに対し、断定の文末形式は文全体を一単位として話し手のさらなる評価の対象とする。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ki"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0204-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-construction-finite-verb-noyne-an-siran-humas","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality"],"statement":{"en":"The construction [finite verb + noyne + (an / siran / humas)] expresses 'it seems that ~' or 'it looks like ~'.","ja":"「動詞人称形＋noyne＋(an, siran, húmas)」の形式で，「〜するらしい，〜するようだ」という意味を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["noyne","an","siran","humas"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0211-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--ishi-h-expresses-the-speaker-s-intention-or","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"Ishi-hō expresses the speaker's intention or will.","ja":"意志法は話者の意志を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu-ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0193-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--for-uncertain-actions-such-as-future-actions-kusu","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"For uncertain actions such as future actions, kusu is attached to the verb.","ja":"未来など未確定な行為の時は、動詞に kusu を付けて使う。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["for uncertain actions such as future"]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0031-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-construction-kusu-kara-expresses-that-an-event","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The construction kusu kara expresses that an event is about to happen, is intended, or looks likely to happen.","ja":"kusu kara は「～するところだ」「～しようとしている」「～しそうだ」を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu kara"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0077-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-auxiliary-verb-kusu-expresses-intention-to-do","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary verb kusu expresses intention to do something in the future ('will ~ from now on').","ja":"助動詞 kusu は《これから～する（意志）》を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0100-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-auxiliary-for-the-intentional-mood-consists-of","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary for the intentional mood consists of kusu in combination with the transitive verb ki 'do'.","ja":"意志法（intentional mood）の助動詞はkusuと他動詞ki「する」の組み合わせから成る。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu","ki"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0246-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--a-verb-personal-form-followed-by-kus-u","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"A verb personal form followed by kus(u) ne expresses 'intend to, try to, or be going to'.","ja":"動詞人称形＋ kus(u) ne で「するつもりだ, しようとする, ことになる」という意味を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kus ne","kusu ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0209-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kus-ne-is-often-followed-by-the-sentence","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"'kus ne' is often followed by the sentence-final particles 'na' or 'wa' when transmitting information or appealing to the addressee.","ja":"kus ne は聞き手に情報を伝達したり訴えかけを行う場合に用いられることが多く，終助詞 na や wa が後続することが多い。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kus ne","na","wa"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0210-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-use-of-the-mood-particle-kusu-ne","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--kusu-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The use of the mood particle kusu-ne has been extended to express future tense and polite imperatives.","ja":"法助詞kusu-neの用法は未来時制や丁寧な命令へと拡張されている。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu-ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0051-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-particle-nankor-functions-as-a-conjectural-particle","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--nankor"],"statement":{"en":"The particle nankor functions as a conjectural particle ('probably'), a mild command, or a rhetorical question marker.","ja":"nankor は想像の助詞、柔らかな命令、または反語として用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["nankor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0165-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-forms-an-ne-singular-and-okai-ne","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--nankor"],"statement":{"en":"The forms an-ne (singular) and okai-ne (plural) serve as sentence endings of conjecture.","ja":"an-ne（単数）および okai-ne（複数）は推量の結びとなる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["an-ne","okai-ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0168-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-auxiliary-nankor-expresses-doubt-about-the-validity","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--nankor"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary nankor expresses doubt about the validity of a statement, while implying that the speaker feels it to be quite probable for the statement to be or to become true.","ja":"助動詞 nankor は陳述の妥当性に対する疑念を表すが、その陳述が真であるか真になることが十分にあり得ると話し手が感じていることを含意する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["nankor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0200-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-auxiliary-nankor-expresses-doubt-about-the-validity-2","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--nankor"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary nankor expresses doubt about the validity of a statement.","ja":"助動詞 nankor は、命題の妥当性に対する疑いを表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["nankor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0201-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--when-a-speaker-uses-nankor-he-implies-that","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--nankor"],"statement":{"en":"When a speaker uses nankor, he implies that he feels it to be quite probable for the statement to be or to become true.","ja":"話者が nankor を用いる場合、その陳述が真であるか、または真になることがかなり蓋然的であると感じていることが含意される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["nankor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0201-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-conjectural-auxiliary-nankor-combining-with-a-finite","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--nankor"],"statement":{"en":"The conjectural auxiliary 'nankor', combining with a finite verb, expresses conjecture ('probably / will ~').","ja":"推量の助動詞 nankor は動詞人称形に後続して「～するだろう」という意味を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["nankor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0210-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--nankor-primarily-expresses-conjecture-about-future-events-but","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--nankor"],"statement":{"en":"'nankor' primarily expresses conjecture about future events, but can also express conjecture about present or past situations.","ja":"nankor は未来の事象についての推量を表すが，現在や過去の事態についての推量を表す場合にも用いられる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["nankor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0210-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--the-conjunctions-kotom-no-and-noine-express-seeming","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topics":["topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality--scope"],"statement":{"en":"The conjunctions kotom(no) and noine express 'seeming to be...' ('...rashiku').","ja":"kotom(no) および noine は「……らしく」を意味する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kotom","kotomno","noine"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0162-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
